      "kind": "reference",
      "section": "literature",
      "text": "Sandve 等人建議，研究者應留下足以說明每項結果如何產生的紀錄。本文借用這項原則檢視引文筆記。另一位讀者拿到筆記後，找得到當初支持這句話的材料嗎？",
      "location": "Rule 1",
      "title": "Ten Simple Rules for Reproducible Computational Research",
      "citation": "Geir Kjetil Sandve et al., “Ten Simple Rules for Reproducible Computational Research,” PLOS Computational Biology 9, no. 10 (2013): e1003285",
