    {
      "id": "R-prov2013",
      "kind": "reference",
      "section": "literature",
      "text": "世界資訊網協會的 PROV 資料模型區分實體、活動及衍生關係。依這個區分，原文和筆記可以分別登錄，再說明筆記如何取材自原文。這套模型能指引資料欄位的設計，回查耗時仍須另外測量。",
      "location": "第 2.1.1 節及第 2.1.2 節",
      "title": "PROV-DM: The PROV Data Model",
      "citation": "Luc Moreau and Paolo Missier, eds., PROV-DM: The PROV Data Model (W3C, April 30, 2013)",
      "bibliography": "Moreau, Luc, and Paolo Missier, eds. PROV-DM: The PROV Data Model. W3C Recommendation, April 30, 2013.",
